{
  "format": "aibdoc",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Swarm phase 1: how it works (as built)",
  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "id": "p1",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "2571760180.4",
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm phase 1: how it works (as built)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.229",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Written from the code on ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "integration/beta10",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " (swarm merge 9a6d433), not from the design. Where they differ, the code wins (see section 9). Paths are relative to ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "outputs/agent-studio/",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " unless marked.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.230",
          "type": "callout",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "variant": "warning"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.503",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Six problems found while reading the code (details in section 9): a Merge again conflict shows nothing; long reports lose their summary (clipping keeps the start); a closed helper can't be merged; Undo can take back someone else's merge in a rare race; \"waiting\" is never used, so a helper's question reads as \"done\"; a helper with a shell can compute its main chat's key from a readable file and call ",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "merge_helper",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " itself. All are on the task list.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.231",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "1. What it does",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.232",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A main chat's agent can hand parts of a job to ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "helper",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " agents, often from another provider (Codex, Gemini CLI, Claude Code). Each helper runs in its own chat, in its own git worktree on a ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "studio/helper-…",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " branch. When a helper's turn ends, AIB builds a ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "report",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ": AIB's own git facts plus the helper's reply text, wrapped as data. AIB sends it to the main chat. The main agent lands the helper's work on main with ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "merge_helper",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", and AIB posts one line: \"Merged “X” (Codex) into main · 1 commit · ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Undo",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\". Undo adds a revert commit; ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Merge again",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " reverts that revert. Nothing rewrites history. AIB never runs a test command itself.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.233",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Walk-through: a web app",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.234",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The owner has a React + Express project in ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "C:\\code\\shopfront",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". They open a Claude Code chat there; like every chat, it works in its own worktree on ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "studio/chat-1a2b3c4d",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". They type:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.235",
          "type": "blockquote",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.1860",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Fix the login bug and write the settings page; give the login bug to Codex.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.236",
          "type": "orderedList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "type": null,
            "start": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.1940",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.1941",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The main agent calls ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "helper_providers",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". It learns that Codex, Claude Code and OMP are listed, that Gemini is off (a Beta agent), and that 0 of 3 helpers are running.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.2115",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.2116",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "It calls ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "start_helper",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " for the login bug: ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "title",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " \"Login bug\", ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "job",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " \"debug\", ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "provider",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " \"codex\", ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "why",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " \"the user asked for Codex\", ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "owns",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "[\"server/auth/**\", \"client/src/login/**\"]",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
