                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Codex finishes. AIB posts \"Report from “Login bug” (Codex): 2 file(s) changed, +14 −3, 1 commit(s)\" ",
