          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "10. Diagram",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.288",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "language": "mermaid"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "flowchart TD\n  U[Owner types a request in the main chat] --> M[Main agent, in its own worktree]\n  M -->|helper_providers| P[Rules, caps, providers]\n  M -->|start_helper| S{Checks: main chat? brief ok? cap 3? owns clash? provider ok?}\n  S -->|refused| M\n  S -->|ok: record + Started helper line| C[connect with helperOf]\n  C --> W[New worktree on studio/helper-xxxx]\n  W --> O{Opens in 120 s? signed in? mode set?}\n  O -->|no| F[Failed line]\n  O -->|yes| B[Brief sent as first prompt]\n  B --> H[Helper turn: edits, own tests, commits]\n  H --> T[2-second watcher sees the turn end]\n  T --> R[Report: git facts + reply, nonce-wrapped]\n  R -->|steer / prompt / paused queue / later| M\n  M -->|merge_helper| G{Helper idle? main moved?}\n  G -->|conflicts| HC[Helper asked to resolve] --> H\n  G -->|lands| MAIN[(main moves forward)]\n  MAIN --> L[Merged line with Undo]\n  L -->|Undo, page only| UN[Revert commit via merge-tree]\n  UN -->|same lines changed later| X[Can't undo cleanly]\n  UN --> MA[Merge again] -->|revert of the revert| MAIN"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.289",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
