          "id": "2571760180.22624",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Draft site copy by the copywriter, checked against the code (page 1). Not live. Lines I corrected are marked ✎.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22625",
          "type": "callout",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "variant": "info"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.22768",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "No Lincoln pun added: the site already has two (\"An agent pool divided against itself cannot stand\", \"Honest Abe would list these first\").\nWhen swarm ships, the Worktrees page and its home card need a one-line fix: they say agents \"merge their own work\", which helpers can't do.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22626",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Recommended headline",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22627",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm: one chat runs Codex, Gemini and Claude Code on your project at once (Beta)",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22628",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It names real agents, can't be mistaken for one vendor's own subagents, and stays true as phase 2 ships. Alternatives: \"Swarm: hand jobs to other agents and get their work on main with one click to undo\" (sells the merge), or \"Swarm: a team of agents from every provider, on your own PC\" (vaguer).",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22629",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Home-page card",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22630",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm: one chat runs Codex, Gemini and Claude Code on your project at once (Beta)",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\nAsk your chat to have Codex fix the login bug while Claude writes the settings page. Each helper works in its own copy, reports back, and lands on main as one line with an Undo button, all on your PC.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22631",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Release-notes entry (beta.10)",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22632",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 4
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm (Beta): one chat runs helpers from every provider, and their work lands on main with Undo",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22633",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Splitting a job across agents meant a chat per agent, a brief for each and merging every branch yourself. Now you ask one chat, and its agent starts helpers from Codex, Claude Code, Gemini or any other agent you've turned on, each in its own copy of the project. Helpers report back into your chat, and each merge shows one line, such as Merged \"Fix login bug\" (Codex) into main · 3 commits, with ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Undo",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Merge again",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". Only the main agent merges, at most 3 helpers run per project, no two helpers own the same files, and it all runs on your PC with no AIB cloud.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22634",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feature page",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22635",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Intro.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " Your web app has a login bug, a slow search page and a signup form with no tests. You could open three chats with three agents, write three briefs, watch three windows and merge three branches by hand. Or you tell one chat: \"Have Codex fix the login bug, Gemini speed up search, and add signup tests yourself.\" The main agent starts each helper in its own copy of the project. Helpers report back into your chat, and their work lands on main one line at a time, each with an ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Undo",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " button.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22636",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cross-agent helpers: the right agent for each job, from one chat",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22637",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any agent you've set up in AIB can be a helper: a Claude Code chat can send work to Codex, a Codex chat to Claude Code. Give each job to the agent that's good at it, or the one that still has plan left, without leaving your chat. Each helper uses its own CLI and your own sign-in for that provider. ✎ Claude helpers are on by default; you can turn them off.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22638",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Own copy per helper: helpers never touch your folder or each other",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22639",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Every helper works in its own git worktree and branch, started from main. No agent edits your project folder directly, so the file open in your editor doesn't change under you. Two running helpers can't own the same files.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22640",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Reports in your chat: no tab-hopping to see what helpers did",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22641",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a helper finishes, a report lands in your main chat: files changed, lines added and removed, and commits, counted by AIB itself, plus what the helper says it did. ✎ Each helper is told to run its own tests and say whether they passed; AIB shows that result as the helper's word, not its own check. Each helper is also a chat of its own you can open.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22642",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One-line merges with Undo: helpers' work lands on main, and one click takes it back",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22643",
          "type": "blockquote",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26230",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Merged \"Fix login bug\" (Codex) into main · 3 commits ",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Undo",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22644",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✎ ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Undo",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " adds one commit that takes the merge back out of main; nothing is rewritten. ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Merge again",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " puts it back. If later work changed the same lines, Undo says so and changes nothing. If main moved on before the merge, the helper's copy is brought up to date first; if that clashes, the helper is asked to fix it before anything lands.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22645",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Guards: helpers can't merge themselves, multiply or step on each other",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22646",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26717",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.26718",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Only the main agent merges.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " A helper can't merge its own work into main.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26798",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.26799",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helpers can't start helpers.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " One level only.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26851",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.26852",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "At most 3 helpers per project",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " at a time.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26900",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.26901",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "No shared files",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " between running helpers.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.26949",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.26950",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Nobody edits your folder.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Every agent works in its own copy.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27018",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27019",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "✎ ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Your edits are safe.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Uncommitted changes in your project folder are set aside during a merge or Undo and put back after.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22647",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Local: your PC, your agents, no AIB cloud",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22648",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Helpers run on your PC as the same CLIs you already use. AIB has no cloud service, account or servers in between; your prompts and code go only to the providers of the agents you use.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22649",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How it works",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22650",
          "type": "orderedList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "type": null,
            "start": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27399",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27400",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Ask in your chat",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", e.g. \"Have Codex fix the login bug and Claude write the settings page.\"",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27497",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27498",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The main agent starts the helpers",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", each in its own copy, with a brief and the files it owns.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27598",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27599",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helpers work",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " in their own copies at the same time.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27657",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27658",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helpers report back",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " into your chat.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.27701",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.27702",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The main agent merges",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " each helper's work; each merge posts one line with ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Undo",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ".",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22651",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What's not built yet",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.22652",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm is Beta. Planned, not shipped: helpers grouped under the main chat in the sidebar (for now each is its own chat); one inbox entry for a whole swarm (for now helpers notify like any chat); a Helpers strip; helper labels on the phone. Swarm needs a git project, because helpers work in worktrees.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Design (before build)",
      "id": "ps663ii",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28126",
          "type": "callout",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "variant": "info"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.28203",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "This is the design as written on 2026-11-13, before the architect review and the build. Where it differs from what was built, the \"How it works\" page wins; its section 9 lists the differences. Owner decisions since: the main chat works in its own worktree (not the project folder); Claude helpers are on by default.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28127",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Swarm: one chat runs agents from every provider",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28128",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AIB hallmark feature · product design v1 · 2026-11-13 · for ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "integration/beta10",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " · complete design; the choices are made (builder notes in the appendix)",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28129",
          "type": "blockquote",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.28732",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "\"I really just want us to chat with one agent and have that agent spin up agents from any other provider\" — \"the hallmark feature of this application\".",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.28887",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The owner, carried word for word. Everything below serves this sentence.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28130",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Legend:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28131",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.28973",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.28974",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "[Owner] the owner asked for this or decided it",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29024",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29025",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "(untagged choice) a choice I made; it ships unless the owner says otherwise",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29104",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29105",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "[Addition] something the owner did not ask for",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29155",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29156",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "(untagged trade-off) a real cost either way; default chosen, owner may want a say",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28132",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In short",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28133",
          "type": "bulletList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29254",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29255",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You talk to ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "one main agent",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " in one chat. It works on ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "main",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " directly. [Owner]",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29345",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29346",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When a job splits well, it ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "starts helpers from any provider",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, OMP, Copilot CLI, OpenCode...). It picks each one from a rule list you can see and edit. Each helper is a ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "normal AIB chat in its own worktree",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", on your computer.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29615",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29616",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helpers ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "report back on their own",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " when they finish. The main agent ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "merges them into main without asking",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " and posts one line: ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Merged \"Login tests\" (Codex) into main · Undo",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ". [Owner]",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29815",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29816",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "AIB itself enforces the caps: at most 3 helpers at once, no helpers of helpers, a daily budget, and approvals from you only. It never relies on the agent to follow them.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.29989",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.29990",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When a provider runs out of usage, AIB hands that helper's work to another provider and tells you in the chat. No single vendor will build this, because it needs everyone's agents in one place.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28134",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contents:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28135",
          "type": "orderedList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
