          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28144",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "3. Main chat: watch helpers work",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28145",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The main chat looks like any chat. Three things are new: helper cards where the main agent starts them, report cards when they finish, and a thin ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Helpers strip",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " above the composer with the meter.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28146",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(mockup) Main chat in project \"shop-api\", header \"main · edits the project folder\":",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28147",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "language": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Sidebar:\n  shop-api\n  [C] Main chat            (selected)\n    [X] Login tests\n    [G] Find rate-limit code\n  [X] Old: billing bug\n\nYou: Fix the flaky login tests, add rate limiting to /login, and update the API docs.\n\nClaude Code · Opus: I'll do the rate limit and the docs myself. Two helpers take the rest: Codex fixes the tests, Gemini finds every place we already throttle requests.\n\n[helper card, done]    [X] Login tests - Done 6 min\n  Codex · default model · rule: tests and bulk edits · owns test/login/** · $0.38\n[helper card, working] [G] Find rate-limit code - Working 3 min\n  Gemini CLI · Flash · rule: read-only search · read only · cost not reported\n\n[report card] [X] Report from Login tests (from a helper, not from you)   Open chat | See changes\n  - Cause: two tests shared one mock clock. Each test now gets its own.\n  - 3 files changed, +41 -18. 2 commits on aib/helper-login-tests.\n  - Done when: npm test -- login passes 20 runs in a row - passed.\n\n↳ Merged \"Login tests\" (Codex) into main · 2 commits · Undo\n\nClaude Code · Opus: Tests merged. Writing the rate limit now; I'll fold in Gemini's list when it lands.\n\n[Helpers strip] Helpers [G] 1 working · 1 merged   meter: 14 of 120 min today · $0.38   Rules | Stop helpers\n[Composer] Reply to the main agent…   [Claude Code] [Opus]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.28148",
          "type": "orderedList",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "type": null,
            "start": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.37583",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.37584",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Helper card",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " (one per helper, placed where it started, updated live): provider letter and colour, task title, status pill, provider and model, ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "why it was picked",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " (the rule), what it owns, and cost. Clicking it opens the helper's own chat.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.37834",
              "type": "listItem",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "content": [
                {
                  "id": "2571760180.37835",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
                  "attrs": {
                    "align": null
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Report card",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": arrives on its own when the helper finishes, so the main agent never has to poll. It's marked \"from a helper, not from you\" because the main agent reads it as data, not as orders.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "agentEdit",
                          "attrs": {
                            "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                          }
                        }
                      ]
