        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50697",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "13. Privacy and terms: local, your own logins",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50698",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is an inline note shown once, the first time a main chat starts a helper (not a pop-up), plus a short line in Settings › Helpers. [Owner] (8a)",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50699",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "(mockup) Main chat:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50700",
          "type": "blockquote",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "content": [
            {
              "id": "2571760180.56796",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Helpers run on your computer, with your own logins",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.56852",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Each helper is the provider's own app, signed in with your own account. AIB never sees or stores your passwords or tokens. A helper sends the files it works on to ",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "its",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " provider, so the rule list decides which provider sees what.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.57089",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Claude helpers on a Claude subscription",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " are allowed today, but Anthropic's terms assume ordinary, individual use. AIB sends bulk helper jobs to other providers first.",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "2571760180.57263",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
              "attrs": {
                "align": null
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "[Got it]  Edit the rules",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "agentEdit",
                      "attrs": {
                        "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50701",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Why this wording",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ": Anthropic's current legal page allows \"an end user ... signing in to the unmodified Claude Code binary with their own Claude subscription\", and its usage limits \"assume ordinary, individual usage\". AIB runs the official adapter with the user's own login and never proxies tokens. The open risk is that this can change without notice. OpenAI's \"Sign in with ChatGPT\" is more permissive.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50702",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Keep a provider out of a project",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ": a per-project setting, \"Never send this project to: …\". The rule list skips that provider there. [Addition]",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50703",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "14. Agent side: the main agent's tools",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50704",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "These tools sit in the existing ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "studio_artifact",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " MCP server (same process, same per-chat key) and are offered only when the chat is a ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "main chat",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ": one that runs in the project folder, not in a worktree. Helper chats never get them. Every call goes to ",
              "marks": [
                {
