          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Helper record (",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "state/helpers.json",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", survives restarts and the keeper): id, parent conversation, helper conversation, provider, model, rule, picked_by, brief, worktree, branch, base SHA, state, minutes, cost, review, merged range, revert SHAs, provider history.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50714",
          "type": "heading",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null,
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "16. Prior art: adopt, port, skip",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2571760180.50715",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e",
          "attrs": {
            "align": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "From ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "private/designs/swarm/swarm-prior-art-2026-11-13.md",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and the market notes. The gap AIB fills: Agent HQ and Warp mix providers in the cloud; Paseo, Orca, Emdash and Air mix them locally, but the ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " starts each agent; CAO and PAL ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "clink",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                },
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " let one agent start another provider, but in tmux with no UI. Nobody ships a desktop app where one main agent starts helpers from any provider, each a visible chat in its own worktree, and merges them.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "agentEdit",
                  "attrs": {
                    "by": "claude:a16e40ca-fbee-46c2-9e61-388e4b23cb4e"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
